<section id="using-the-logo">
<h2>Using the logo</h2>
<ul>
<li>Keep the colours, proportions and letter shapes as they are.</li>
<li>Leave empty space around the logo, at least half as wide as the logo is tall.</li>
<li>Don't add shadows, outlines or effects, and don't put the logo on a busy photo.</li>
<li>Link the logo to <a href="/">beverified.org</a> when you use it on a website.</li>
</ul>
<p>Showing our logo, or listing BeVerified as a partner, never changes a provider's score or its place in a ranking. Scores come only from our <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a> and public evidence.</p>
</section>

